// Gate rows — read by `cargo xtask gate` (`just gate`). One row per invariant and per
// pinned contract. Three states and nothing else:
//   Bound(file, control)  a test file asserts it and `control` is its positive control fn (W2)
//   Awaiting(reason)      blocked on hardware, an operator, or an input not on disk
//   Unbuilt(reason)       the subsystem does not exist yet, and the reason says why
// "Nobody got to it" is not a reason (W9). Row ids are identities: never renumber.
(
    rows: [
        (id: "I1", name: "no-bare-position", state: Bound(file: "tests/liveness/test_frame_liveness.rs", control: "positive_control_every_rule_flags_its_violation")),
