        (id: "C-asset-usd-fbx", name: "usd-and-fbx-importers", state: Unbuilt(reason: "Ch.8 names USD (first-class) and FBX via ufbx; WP-12 builds glTF 2.0, PNG/JPEG and KTX2 importers on the Importer extension point. USD needs a composition engine (no permissive pure-Rust one exists yet) and ufbx is a C library behind an unsafe binding; both are follow-up importers on the same point")),
