        (id: "C-identity-backend", name: "team-management-runs-on-forge-identity", state: Unbuilt(reason: "D-4: the team panel and the core's team commands run over the IdentityBackend trait; the labelled in-memory MemoryIdentity (forge_project::collab: local accounts, teams, roles, scopes, email and join-code invites) stands in until forge-identity (M5-15, local accounts and bring-your-own OIDC) exists")),
        (id: "C-collab-backend", name: "sandboxes-baseline-presence-claims-and-review-run-on-forge-collab-and-forge-server", state: Unbuilt(reason: "D-4: the collaboration panels and the core run over the CollabBackend trait; the labelled in-memory MemoryCollab keeps sandbox rows, presence, claims and the review queue in memory over a real baseline ProjectStore (Git tested). forge-collab / forge-server (M5-18, M6-10), with authn on connect and per-user plugin capabilities, are not built")),
        // WP-47: the editor binary reads the signed entitlement file, verified offline by forge-licence (the in-memory MemoryEntitlement stays for tests and the audits' populated pass).
